<title>USA: NGT stock split effective, changes name.</title>
<headline>NGT stock split effective, changes name.</headline>
<dateline>MELVILLE, N.Y. 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>NGT Enterprises Inc said Friday it received notification from the OTC Bulletin Board that the one-for-four reverse stock split the company announced on May 7 became effective May 15.</p>
<p>The company said in a release that its shares of common stock began trading under a new name, IMN Financial Corp, and symbol, IMNF.OB, at the opening of the market Friday.</p>
<p>Based on the closing price on May 15 of $1.50, the one-for-four reverse split should create a post reverse split bid price of about $6.00 per share, the company said.</p>
